- * auto_input_limit=0 leaves the limit alone. Register layout follows
- * Samsung's GPL sm5705.h, sm5705_charger.c and muic_regmap_sm5705.c. The
- * chip has no usable interrupt here yet, so its status is polled.
+/* SM-T825 SM5705 charging with verified limits and temperature protection.
+ * Calibration and conservative limits: sm5705-gts3l-policy.h.
